Line 3: I can't join a list of numbers with a list of text.
    say numbers followed by names
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Only lists of the same kind join into one list. To join them as text, turn one into text first with "as text".

Line 5: I can't join a list of lists of numbers with a list of numbers.
    say grid followed by numbers
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Only lists of the same kind join into one list. To join them as text, turn one into text first with "as text".
